<title>USA: Ryerson Tull to buy Cardinal Metals.</title>
<headline>Ryerson Tull to buy Cardinal Metals.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryerson Tull Inc said Monday it signed a definitive agreement to buy the assets of Cardinal Metals Inc, a privately held distributor and processor of carbon steel products.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, expected to close in March, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Cardinal, which has a single production facility in Pounding Mill, Va., had 1996 sales of $23 million.</p>
<p>Ryerson Tull distributes and processes metals. It is 87 percent owned by Inland Steel Industries Inc.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
